1.1.0 - 2026-08-11
- Modular optional media support for pip-boy.com installs.
- Added new startup assets including Enclave PIP-BOY.
- Uses TITLE.BIN as the single title image format.
- Removed runtime APPINFO self-registration; installation is metadata-driven.
- Removed legacy global.__SA* / global.__startupAnimations* state and cleanup.
- Replaced the global CRT-suppression flag with local holotape state.
- Preserves the V84 hardware-tested startup playback and timing behavior.
